<title>CANADA: Quebecor unit to acquire regional papers.</title>
<headline>Quebecor unit to acquire regional papers.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quebecor Communications Inc said on Tuesday that it signed a letter of intent to acquire Le Groupe Bellavance Inc of Rimouski, Quebec.</p>
<p>The value of the transaction was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Quebecor Communications, a unit of Quebecor Inc, said the deal was subject to due diligence and execution of a definitive agreement before April 18.</p>
<p>Le Groupe Bellavance owns 12 publications in Quebec with a weekly circulation of 146,000 copies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
